{
  "name": "j-aeneas-full",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 122.697,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Why did Aeneas, the hero Rome called its founder, wander for seven years, when Italy was three weeks' sail from Troy?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.718,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "4f34971f904f"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "The answer is on this route, and in one goddess's grudge.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.299,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "4f34971f904f"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It begins in burning Troy, in modern Turkey.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.227,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d3d06fa3c7b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Aeneas carries his old father out on his back.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.97,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d3d06fa3c7b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "First stop: Thrace, where a bleeding myrtle warns him to leave.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.059,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d3d06fa3c7b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "On Delos, Apollo's oracle tells him: seek your ancient mother.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.165,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d3d06fa3c7b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "His father reads it as Crete.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.467,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d3d06fa3c7b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Then a plague drives them out.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.841,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d3d06fa3c7b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In a dream, the gods correct him.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.124,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d3d06fa3c7b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "The mother is Italy, where his ancestors came from.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.094,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d3d06fa3c7b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03a",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A storm throws them onto the islands of the Harpies.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.635,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "64e6a97caabc"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Their curse: one day, you will be hungry enough to eat your tables.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.757,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d083d1128da7"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "At Buthrotum, a prophet warns him: don't take the short way.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.651,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d083d1128da7"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Scylla and Charybdis guard the strait.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.14,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d083d1128da7"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "So they see Italy for the very first time, and have to sail on.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.153,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d083d1128da7"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "They circle Sicily, past the Cyclops under Mount Etna.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.53,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "d083d1128da7"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.5,
      "text": "At Drepanum, his father dies.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.548,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "c59ff976c06e"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 2,
      "text": "The man he carried out of burning Troy never sees Italy.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.812,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "c59ff976c06e"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Now the goddess strikes.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.947,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "44b74aea8470"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Juno loves one city above all, Carthage, and a prophecy says Aeneas' descendants will destroy it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.409,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "44b74aea8470"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Her storm throws the fleet to Africa, right into Carthage.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.814,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "44b74aea8470"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Queen Dido tells him: this is your seventh summer at sea.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.826,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "44b74aea8470"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He stays, until the gods order him to leave.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.241,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "44b74aea8470"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Dido curses his people: our nations will be enemies forever.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.08,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "44b74aea8470"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "That is how Virgil explains why Rome and Carthage later fought three wars.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.94,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "44b74aea8470"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "At Cumae, the Sibyl leads him into the underworld, where his father shows him Rome.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.483,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "44b74aea8470"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "At last, at the mouth of the Tiber, they use flat bread as plates, and eat them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.195,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "144954f228b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "His son laughs: we're eating our tables.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.553,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "144954f228b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The curse was a joke.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.421,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "144954f228b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "They had arrived.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.092,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "144954f228b0"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "Three weeks of sailing became seven years and more than three thousand kilometres.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.147,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "c20e2e7dd61e"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.25,
      "text": "A misread oracle, a strait he couldn't take, and a goddess who wanted him lost.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/32.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.42,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "c20e2e7dd61e"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.4,
      "text": "And his descendants, Romulus and Remus, would found Rome.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/j-aeneas-full/33.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.939,
      "tempo": 1.05,
      "hash": "c20e2e7dd61e"
    }
  ]
}
